[["page"],{"pageNumber":2,"width":595.276,"height":782.362,"rotation":0,"renderRotation":0,"structureRoles":{},"graphicsOperators":{"paintImageXObject":1},"captionStarts":[{"text":"Fig. 1. Conceptual model","fontSize":7.5,"x":48.189,"y":736.5,"width":82.85249999999999,"height":7.5}],"headingCandidates":[],"lines":[{"text":"ann. behav. med. (2023) 57:988–1000 989","fontSize":8,"x":48.189,"y":26.01559999999995,"width":504.56800000000004,"height":8},{"text":"of side effects), are associated with lower AET adherence","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":51.674999999999955,"width":243.30922500000005,"height":9.25},{"text":"[6, 10–16]. The Necessity-Concerns Framework (NCF) sug-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":62.67324999999994,"width":243.2851749999999,"height":9.25},{"text":"gests women weigh up their personal perceived need for AET,","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":73.67149999999992,"width":243.64314999999996,"height":9.25},{"text":"against their concerns in a cost-benefit analysis to decide","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":84.66974999999991,"width":243.298125,"height":9.25},{"text":"whether to take AET [17].","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":95.66799999999989,"width":104.99675000000008,"height":9.25},{"text":"An extended version of the self-regulation model of illness","fontSize":9.25,"x":57.439,"y":106.66624999999988,"width":234.00649999999993,"height":9.25},{"text":"suggests illness representations could influence key medica-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":117.66449999999986,"width":243.26574999999994,"height":9.25},{"text":"tion beliefs regarding the necessity or concerns of medication","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":128.66274999999985,"width":243.3120000000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"[17, 18]. For example, stronger beliefs that AET can reduce","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189,"y":139.66099999999983,"width":243.30922500000005,"height":9.25},{"text":"the risk of recurrence (treatment control) have been associ-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":150.65924999999982,"width":243.27499999999998,"height":9.25},{"text":"ated with increased necessity beliefs, and reduced concerns","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":161.6574999999998,"width":243.2750000000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"[19]. Similarly, better understanding of how AET works (co-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":172.65574999999978,"width":243.29997499999996,"height":9.25},{"text":"herence) has been associated with fewer AET concerns, while","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":183.65399999999977,"width":243.26759999999996,"height":9.25},{"text":"attributing more physiological sensations (identity) to AET","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":194.65224999999975,"width":243.29164999999983,"height":9.25},{"text":"(e.g., side effects) has been associated with increased AET","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":205.65049999999974,"width":243.292575,"height":9.25},{"text":"concerns [19]. It has been hypothesized that necessity and","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":216.64874999999972,"width":243.29349999999988,"height":9.25},{"text":"concern beliefs mediate the relationship between illness per-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000001,"y":227.6469999999997,"width":243.28424999999976,"height":9.25},{"text":"ceptions (e.g., treatment control, coherence) and medication","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000002,"y":238.6452499999997,"width":243.27500000000003,"height":9.25},{"text":"adherence [18–20]. Therefore, illness representations may be","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000002,"y":249.64349999999968,"width":243.29997499999996,"height":9.25},{"text":"potential intervention targets, which could consequently in-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000002,"y":260.64174999999966,"width":243.28425,"height":9.25},{"text":"fluence necessity and concern beliefs.","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000002,"y":271.63999999999965,"width":146.9825000000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"There is little understanding regarding effective strategies","fontSize":9.25,"x":57.43900000000002,"y":282.63824999999963,"width":234.01574999999997,"height":9.25},{"text":"to target medication beliefs [21–23]. A randomized controlled","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.18900000000002,"y":293.6364999999996,"width":243.28425,"height":9.25},{"text":"trial (RCT) found small to moderate effect sizes on medica-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":304.6347499999996,"width":243.301825,"height":9.25},{"text":"tion beliefs using a three-session cognitive behavioral approach","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":315.6329999999996,"width":243.28425000000004,"height":9.25},{"text":"[24]. RCTs involving single intervention and control arms can","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":326.63124999999957,"width":243.28332500000005,"height":9.25},{"text":"tell us whether the intervention package as a whole is more ef-","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":337.62949999999955,"width":243.31200000000018,"height":9.25},{"text":"fective than a comparator, but they do not provide information","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":348.62774999999954,"width":243.27407499999998,"height":9.25},{"text":"on which components are affecting the outcome, or whether","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":359.6259999999995,"width":243.27499999999992,"height":9.25},{"text":"any components are interacting. This limits our understanding","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":370.6242499999995,"width":243.30090000000007,"height":9.25},{"text":"of how we can effectively target medication beliefs.","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":381.6224999999995,"width":199.28199999999987,"height":9.25},{"text":"Medication beliefs are complex, and therefore a","fontSize":9.25,"x":57.439000000000036,"y":392.6207499999995,"width":234.05275000000017,"height":9.25},{"text":"multicomponent intervention may be needed to target all","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":403.61899999999946,"width":243.28517499999998,"height":9.25},{"text":"aspects of the construct. The multiphase optimization strategy","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":414.61724999999944,"width":243.30829999999992,"height":9.25},{"text":"(MOST) is a framework used to optimize multicomponent","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":425.61549999999943,"width":243.28517500000004,"height":9.25},{"text":"interventions [25, 26]. MOST consists of three phases. The","fontSize":9.25,"x":48.189000000000036,"y":436.6137499999994,"width":243.27592499999997,"height":9.25},{"text":"first and final phases reflect a classical approach in which an","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":51.61024999999938,"width":243.29349999999994,"height":9.25},{"text":"intervention package is prepared, and then evaluated, typ-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":62.60849999999937,"width":243.29349999999994,"height":9.25},{"text":"ically with a parallel groups RCT. MOST advocates for an","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":73.60674999999935,"width":243.30182500000018,"height":9.25},{"text":"additional optimization phase between the preparation and","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":84.60499999999934,"width":243.26575000000008,"height":9.25},{"text":"evaluation phases. In this optimization phase, highly efficient,","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":95.60324999999932,"width":243.6357500000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"fully powered experimental designs are used to estimate the","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":106.6014999999993,"width":243.26575000000008,"height":9.25},{"text":"main and interaction effects of intervention components [27].","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":117.59974999999929,"width":243.64499999999992,"height":9.25},{"text":"Optimization trials allow intervention developers to screen","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":128.59799999999927,"width":243.29349999999994,"height":9.25},{"text":"out components having a negative or null effect on an out-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":139.59624999999926,"width":243.29349999999982,"height":9.25},{"text":"come, or that are not justified based on resource demands.","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":150.59449999999924,"width":243.63574999999997,"height":9.25},{"text":"This has the potential to create more effective, affordable,","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":161.59274999999923,"width":243.62650000000014,"height":9.25},{"text":"scalable, and efficient intervention packages [28].","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":172.5909999999992,"width":195.9890000000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"We aimed to prepare and optimize an information leaflet","fontSize":9.25,"x":318.72375000000005,"y":183.5892499999992,"width":234.00650000000002,"height":9.25},{"text":"intervention, aiming to increase necessity beliefs and reduce","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":194.58749999999918,"width":243.3027499999999,"height":9.25},{"text":"concerns about AET. We had three objectives: (i) to evaluate","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":205.58574999999917,"width":243.29904999999968,"height":9.25},{"text":"the main effects of each component of the information leaflet","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":216.58399999999915,"width":243.31199999999995,"height":9.25},{"text":"on beliefs about AET, (ii) to estimate interactions between","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":227.58224999999914,"width":243.2842500000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"components of the information leaflet on beliefs about AET,","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":238.58049999999912,"width":243.65147499999972,"height":9.25},{"text":"and (iii) to establish an optimal combination of information","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":249.5787499999991,"width":243.29350000000005,"height":9.25},{"text":"leaflet components with regard to changing beliefs about AET.","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.47375000000005,"y":260.5769999999991,"width":243.6264999999999,"height":9.25},{"text":"Methods","fontSize":11,"x":309.4725,"y":286.92499999999995,"width":46.44200000000001,"height":11},{"text":"Preparation Phase: Information Leaflet Intervention","fontSize":10,"x":309.4725,"y":302.92499999999995,"width":241.40899999999993,"height":10},{"text":"Development","fontSize":10,"x":309.4725,"y":313.92499999999995,"width":63.339999999999975,"height":10},{"text":"As part of a wider program of research, we used intervention","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":327.67499999999995,"width":243.265750000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"mapping combined with MOST to develop a written informa-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":338.67324999999994,"width":243.28425000000112,"height":9.25},{"text":"tion leaflet to change AET medication beliefs [29]. A written in-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":349.6714999999999,"width":243.262050000001,"height":9.25},{"text":"formation leaflet was chosen, as it is a low cost, implementable","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":360.6697499999999,"width":243.3120000000012,"height":9.25},{"text":"method that can provide accurate information about the bene-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":371.6679999999999,"width":243.2750000000014,"height":9.25},{"text":"fits and risks of AET, which could encourage more balanced","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":382.6662499999999,"width":243.29997500000133,"height":9.25},{"text":"medication beliefs [30–35]. We chose five distinct interven-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":393.66449999999986,"width":243.27685000000037,"height":9.25},{"text":"tion targets, based on the NCF, self-regulation model, causal","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":404.66274999999985,"width":243.26575000000122,"height":9.25},{"text":"learning theory, and existing literature [17, 18, 36]. Our con-","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.4725,"y":415.66099999999983,"width":243.29349999999994,"height":9.25},{"text":"ceptual model details how we hypothesized each component to","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.48175000000003,"y":426.6592499999998,"width":243.2842500000013,"height":9.25},{"text":"influence medication beliefs (Fig. 1). The content of the leaflet","fontSize":9.25,"x":309.48175000000003,"y":437.6574999999998,"width":243.30830000000128,"height":9.25},{"text":"Fig. 1. Conceptual model","fontSize":7.5,"x":48.189,"y":736.5,"width":82.85249999999999,"height":7.5}],"graphicsBounds":[{"operationIndex":487,"kind":"image","normalizedRect":[0.19921875,0.6015625,0.8125,0.93359375],"imageHash":"16692b6ee0f523139a773c0625d59c78f7f8f083dc426fe0a0df5eca94a50d46"}],"invalidGraphicsBounds":0}]
